$MDESC::Type = "TAC";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> TAC Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Zeta Hercules XI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear and cold" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Late Morning" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of Zeta Hercules XI, a cold, formally peacefull world.  Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base. Don't wander to far past the flag bases, cause it gets pretty dangerous. The first team with 30 points shall be the victor!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>For the TAC Mod:<f0> www.tribes-universe.com/tac/" @
         "\n<f1>Map Designed by: <f0> [EL]Orange";